                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/3.2.0"&gt;3.2.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.NET 6 dropped from TFMs; .NET 6 users will still get support via .NET Standard, &lt;strong&gt;but&lt;/strong&gt; note that this does not include unix domain socket endpoint support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;BITFIELD&lt;/code&gt; support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;EVAL_RO&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;EVALSHA_RO&lt;/code&gt; support (gated by server-version)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New &lt;code&gt;ExecuteResp&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;ScriptEvaluateResp&lt;/code&gt; APIs for performing ad-hoc commands &lt;em&gt;much more efficiently&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stability and performance fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cluster definition moved from &lt;code&gt;CLUSTER NODES&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;CLUSTER SLOTS&lt;/code&gt;, improving life-cycle and identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Route from CLUSTER SLOTS, and give endpoints a lifecycle by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5173081361" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3177" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3177/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3177"&gt;#3177&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Return 0 from SortedSetRemove(Async) for an empty member array by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/AbhinavMir/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/AbhinavMir"&gt;@AbhinavMir&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5242795496" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3192" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3192/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3192"&gt;#3192&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tests: don't assume endpoint discovery is synchronous with connect by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5246821246" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3197" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3197/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3197"&gt;#3197&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fill in the neglected bitmap commands: BITFIELD, and an open-ended BITPOS by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5245989441" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3196" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3196/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3196"&gt;#3196&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tests: pin the pruning threshold deterministically, not end-to-end by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5247700182" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3198" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3198/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3198"&gt;#3198&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;add Dragonfly to ProductVariant by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/pairbit/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/pairbit"&gt;@pairbit&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5285569367" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3199" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3199/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3199"&gt;#3199&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Never match responses on a connection whose write failed mid-flight by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5341679637" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3205" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3205/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3205"&gt;#3205&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drop net6.0 from TargetFrameworks by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5389016106" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3208" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3208/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3208"&gt;#3208&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;add ReadOnlyMemory and Lease for Lua and Execute by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/pairbit/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/pairbit"&gt;@pairbit&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5301096909" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3201" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3201/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3201"&gt;#3201&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sync path must wait for completion, not merely for a fault by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5407833304" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3212" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3212/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3212"&gt;#3212&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For ROM-based APIs (mostly ScriptEvaluate/Execute): render request keys and values into one pooled buffer up front by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5399410297" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3211" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3211/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3211"&gt;#3211&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add ExecuteResp vs Execute allocation/time benchmark by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5411956351" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3215" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3215/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3215"&gt;#3215&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prevent response queue writes during connection teardown by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jetersen/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jetersen"&gt;@jetersen&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5292173531" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3200" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3200/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3200"&gt;#3200&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Background work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump SourceLink past &lt;a title="CVE-2026-62900" data-hovercard-type="advisory" data-hovercard-url="/advisories/GHSA-23fw-v26w-5fgq/hovercard" href="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-23fw-v26w-5fgq"&gt;CVE-2026-62900&lt;/a&gt;, and System.IO.Hashing with it by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5398426798" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3210" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3210/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3210"&gt;#3210&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump to 3.2 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5411048159" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3214" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3214/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3214"&gt;#3214&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship 3.2.0 API surface and target the build at 3.2.0 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5413106288" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3216" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3216/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3216"&gt;#3216&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move package publishing from MyGet to NuGet trusted publishing by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5410087747" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3213" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3213/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3213"&gt;#3213&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI: hash the NuGet cache key before starting redis, not after by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5390819523" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3209" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3209/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3209"&gt;#3209&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stop the docs site collecting 404s from mangled links by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5234808168" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3190" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3190/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3190"&gt;#3190&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix tag-triggered releases: accept unprefixed tags, keep 3.2.0 reachable by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5413720111" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3217" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3217/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3217"&gt;#3217&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
